{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 17,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A Sword against Jerusalem"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“And you, O son of man, take a sharp sword; use it as a barber’s razor and pass it over your head and your beard; then take balances for weighing, and divide the hair. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "A third part you shall burn in the fire in the midst of the city, when the days of the siege are completed; and a third part you shall take and strike with the sword round about the city; and a third part you shall scatter to the wind, and I will unsheathe the sword after them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And you shall take from these a small number, and bind them in the skirts of your robe. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And of these again you shall take some, and cast them into the fire, and burn them in the fire; from there a fire will come forth into all the house of Israel. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Thus says the Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ": This is Jerusalem; I have set her in the center of the nations, with countries round about her. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And she has wickedly rebelled against my ordinances"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or changed my ordinances into wickedness"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " more than the nations, and against my statutes more than the countries round about her, by rejecting my ordinances and not walking in my statutes. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore thus says the Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ": Because you are more turbulent than the nations that are round about you, and have not walked in my statutes or kept my ordinances, but have acted"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Another reading is and have not acted"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " according to the ordinances of the nations that are round about you; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "therefore thus says the Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ": Behold, I, even I, am against you; and I will execute judgments in the midst of you in the sight of the nations. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And because of all your abominations I will do with you what I have never yet done, and the like of which I will never do again. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore fathers shall eat their sons in the midst of you, and sons shall eat their fathers; and I will execute judgments on you, and any of you who survive I will scatter to all the winds. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Wherefore, as I live, says the Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", surely, because you have defiled my sanctuary with all your detestable things and with all your abominations, therefore I will cut you down;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Another reading is I will withdraw"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " my eye will not spare, and I will have no pity. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "A third part of you shall die of pestilence and be consumed with famine in the midst of you; a third part shall fall by the sword round about you; and a third part I will scatter to all the winds and will unsheathe the sword after them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Thus shall my anger spend itself, and I will vent my fury upon them and satisfy myself; and they shall know that I, the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", have spoken in my jealousy, when I spend my fury upon them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moreover I will make you a desolation and an object of reproach among the nations round about you and in the sight of all that pass by. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gk Syr Vg Tg: Heb And it shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a reproach and a taunt, a warning and a horror, to the nations round about you, when I execute judgments on you in anger and fury, and with furious chastisements—I, the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", have spoken— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "when I loose against you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " my deadly arrows of famine, arrows for destruction, which I will loose to destroy you, and when I bring more and more famine upon you, and break your staff of bread. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I will send famine and wild beasts against you, and they will rob you of your children; pestilence and blood shall pass through you; and I will bring the sword upon you. I, the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", have spoken.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}